{"pageProps":{"aboutData":{"id":"aTg5thAAACIAuipV","uid":null,"url":"/manifesto","type":"about","href":"https://icomat.cdn.prismic.io/api/v2/documents/search?ref=aqEWxBEAACwAh40-&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aTg5thAAACIAuipV%22%29+%5D%5D","tags":[],"first_publication_date":"2025-12-09T15:01:57+0000","last_publication_date":"2026-02-16T19:51:48+0000","slugs":["about"],"linked_documents":[],"lang":"en-us","alternate_languages":[],"data":{"hero_title_main":"We enable the future\nby removing engineering limits.","hero_text":[],"hero_image":{"dimensions":{"width":2880,"height":1866},"alt":null,"copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/icomat/aVvIynNYClf9oydt_Container.png?auto=format,compress","id":"aVvIynNYClf9oydt","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"background":"transparent"}},"hero_text_mode":"difference","heading_1_text":"For 50 years, composites were limited to straight lines. Not because it was better, but because it was the only option.","heading_2_text":"We refused to accept that.","heading_3_text":"While others optimized outdated systems, we asked a different question: \n\nWhat if fibers could flow like nature intended? What if imagination, not manufacturing, defined the limits of design?","rts_title":"That refusal became RTS \nRapid Tow Shearing.","rts_figure_description":"ICOMAT Carbon composite","rts_text":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"We built the only system in the world that lets fibers follow natural forms. Precisely, reliably, fast, and at scale. We didn’t stop at a lab demo. We built machines that outperform human operators. Software that thinks like nature.\n\nA system that delivers zero-defect steered fiber parts at industrial scale and with no CapEx required. But this isn’t just about composites. It’s about unlocking a new design language for the physical world.  Lighter, faster, stronger, more efficient. It’s about replacing limitations with possibilities.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}],"rts_button":"Build with Icomat","heading_4_text":"We don’t follow rules. We remove them.\nWe don’t argue. We build.\nWe don’t say it’s possible. We show it.","heading_5_text":"We are ICOMAT. \nA new era of manufacturing.","heading_5_cta_label":"Build with Icomat","image_grid_images":[{"image":{"dimensions":{"width":474,"height":636},"alt":null,"copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/icomat/aTkzd3NYClf9oAAS_imageGrid-4.png?auto=format,compress","id":"aTkzd3NYClf9oAAS","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"background":"transparent"}}},{"image":{"dimensions":{"width":1005,"height":636},"alt":null,"copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/icomat/aTkzf3NYClf9oAAa_imageGrid.png?auto=format,compress","id":"aTkzf3NYClf9oAAa","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"background":"transparent"}}},{"image":{"dimensions":{"width":3710,"height":2475},"alt":null,"copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/icomat/aXuCnAIvOtkhCFVW_Picture33.png?auto=format,compress","id":"aXuCnAIvOtkhCFVW","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"background":"transparent"}}},{"image":{"dimensions":{"width":474,"height":636},"alt":null,"copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/icomat/aTkzeXNYClf9oAAU_imageGrid-6.png?auto=format,compress","id":"aTkzeXNYClf9oAAU","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"background":"transparent"}}},{"image":{"dimensions":{"width":474,"height":636},"alt":null,"copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/icomat/aTkze3NYClf9oAAW_imageGrid-8.png?auto=format,compress","id":"aTkze3NYClf9oAAW","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"background":"transparent"}}},{"image":{"dimensions":{"width":3710,"height":2475},"alt":null,"copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/icomat/aXuANgIvOtkhCFRC_Picture28.png?auto=format,compress","id":"aXuANgIvOtkhCFRC","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"background":"transparent"}}},{"image":{"dimensions":{"width":474,"height":636},"alt":null,"copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/icomat/aTkzeHNYClf9oAAT_imageGrid-5.png?auto=format,compress","id":"aTkzeHNYClf9oAAT","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"b